  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_01",
      "hash64": "44C3221A7E778DAF",
      "text": "星尘大作战的时候，\\n真的非常感谢你。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_02",
      "hash64": "44C3231A7E778F62",
      "text": "对牡丹的处理\\n也往好的方向发展了。\\r\\n身为校长，我总算暂且放心了。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_03",
      "hash64": "44C3241A7E779115",
      "text": "牡丹同学非常感谢你哦。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_04",
      "hash64": "44C31D1A7E778530",
      "text": "我深知不应该\\n把这样的事情拜托给别人……[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_05",
      "hash64": "44C31E1A7E7786E3",
      "text": "但是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同学，\\n如果今后你能和牡丹成为好朋友，\\r\\n我会感到十分欣慰。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_select_01",
      "hash64": "CF8A472FB375DBB6",
      "text": "当然了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_select_02",
      "hash64": "CF8A462FB375DA03",
      "text": "我们已经是朋友了",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_06",
      "hash64": "44C31F1A7E778896",
      "text": "……你转到我们学校来，真是太好了。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_07",
      "hash64": "44C3201A7E778A49",
      "text": "这是校长奖，请一定要收下。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_08",
      "hash64": "44C3291A7E779994",
      "text": "希望[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同学你\\n能一直保持这份美好。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_head_d_system_01",
      "hash64": "F469CCFE7E6AD0E1",
      "text": "与克拉韦尔校长之间的\\n牵绊萌芽了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
